      "llm_score": 2,
      "corrected_score": 2,
      "comment": "Checked the plan write's tool response and loc_001. \"Baiersbronn, Württemberg\" is historically correct for 1843 (Kingdom of Württemberg), so the jurisdiction itself is right. But loc_001 is \"Baiersbronn, Freudenstadt, Baden-Württemberg, Germany\", and research_append warned on each plan item that \"Baiersbronn, Württemberg, Germany is not inside any locality this project has researched\". The agent ignored those warnings and left all five items on a place name that doesn't match the project's own locality. The jurisdiction is correct and the place string is inconsistent, so 2 is right."
